  - insurance pricing
  - actuarial science
  - transformer
  - audit
abstract: >-
  R experiment pipeline for studying verifiability obligations vs. deep-model
  opacity in AI pricing models under solvency regulation. Experiments are
  organized along a transparency spectrum (L0-L4: GLM, GAM/GA2M, XGBoost,
  MLP, FT/TCN/TCT Transformers), with controlled 2x2 failure injection and
  component-level audit tools. Datasets: freMTPL2 (main) and Porto (E4 case).
